---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manages organizations and membership

Usage: org [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list               Lists organizations you can see
  create             Creates an organization with you as owner
  members            Lists the members of an organization
  invite             Emails an invitation to join
  invitations        Lists pending invitations
  revoke-invitation  Revokes an invitation; requires its ID again as confirmation
  set-role           Changes a member's role
  remove-member      Removes a member; requires their ID again as confirmation
  help               Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -h, --help
          Print help
